desc:
Every second, restores nearby allies' HP by [<color=$$Yellow$$>{0}</color>%* PATK + <color=$$Yellow$$>{1}</color>] (<color=$$Yellow$$>{2}</color>% * PATK in PvP), with different healing effects based on the number of nearby allies: 
If <color=$$Yellow$$>1</color> party member is within range, healing effect is <color=$$Yellow$$>150</color>%;
if <color=$$Yellow$$>2 or 3</color> party members are within range, healing effect is <color=$$Yellow$$>120</color>%;
if <color=$$Yellow$$>4</color> or more party members are within range, healing effect is <color=$$Yellow$$>100</color>%. [Solo] lasts <color=$$Yellow$$>60</color> seconds.
